\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {6}{\ignorespaces  Accuracy benefit of CoT and causal faithfulness of the resulting chains, for \textsc  {Qwen2.5-1.5B}\xspace  and \textsc  {Qwen2.5-7B}\xspace  on \textsc  {Tau-Stage}\xspace  . Both move together, and both move \emph  {down} with capability: the smaller model gains from reasoning and reasons faithfully, the larger model loses from reasoning and narrates. \relax }}{13}{figure.caption.16}\protected@file@percent }
